{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2022-02-28 11:57:00', 'title': 'MASLANSKY + PARTNERS HIRES JAIME HODGES, PHD, AS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, HEAD OF QUANTITATIVE RESEARCH', 'text': "NEW YORK, FEB. 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LEADING LANGUAGE STRATEGY® FIRM, MASLANSKY + PARTNERS (M+P), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS HIRED JAIME HODGES, PHD, AS ITS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND HEAD OF QUANTITATIVE RESEARCH. IN THIS NEWLY CREATED ROLE AT MASLANSKY + PARTNERS, DR. HODGES WILL EXPAND AND STRENGTHEN M+P'S QUANTITATIVE OFFERING THROUGH PROPRIETARY METHODS THAT INTEGRATE SOPHISTICATED MULTI-METHOD RESEARCH WITH THE FIRM'S DEEP BEHAVIORAL SCIENCE AND LINGUISTICS EXPERTISE."}